ry\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids May to June came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025, July to August came in at 42% of normal on the middle, and August to September in 2025 at 62%. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, with grid 28739 at 62% of normal in 1965.</p>"}
